  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2102.24 Discharges to Groundwater",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2102.24 Discharges to Groundwater. Any discharger to groundwater that provides water use data to the department under Env-Dw 404 or Env-Wq 402 shall be deemed to be in compliance with this part if the information provided includes the information required by Env-Wq 2102.18.\n\nSource. #9279, eff 9-24-08; ss by #12135, eff 3-21-17 (from Env-Wq 2102.23)",
